<title>USA: Meridian says to file form 10K by June 24.</title>
<headline>Meridian says to file form 10K by June 24.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Under threat of having its stock delisted, Meridian National Corp said Friday that it expects to file its Form 10-K by June 24.</p>
<p>The company said it has not filed its Form 10-K annual report for its fiscal year ended February 28.</p>
<p>The company said it has received a notice from The Nasdaq Stock Market that its publicly traded securities are to be delisted from The Nasdaq SmallCap Market effective June 25, 1997 if the company has not filed by such date.</p>
